# The cases of faults_registry.anti: a name and the value of ANTI_FAULT,
# see tests/CMakeLists.txt. The runtime takes the first four allocations
# at the start of the program, and reflect.new the fifth. deserialize
# takes the room of the names it reads with the sixth, for `type`, and
# grows it with the seventh, for `Point`, by T345. It takes the list of
# its objects with the eighth, the list of its blocks with the ninth, the
# object from LibcAllocator with the tenth and the bits of the fields
# with the eleventh. T139: memory that runs out in the runtime there
# gives none, where the program must stop. An allocator that gives none
# makes deserialize give none.
object_memory alloc:5:ENOMEM
names_memory alloc:6:ENOMEM
names_grown_memory alloc:7:ENOMEM
objects_memory alloc:8:ENOMEM
blocks_memory alloc:9:ENOMEM
allocator_none alloc:10:ENOMEM
fields_memory alloc:11:ENOMEM
